  "notes": "Sepsis-3: suspected/documented infection + an acute rise in total SOFA ≥ 2 (assume baseline 0 if the pre-morbid organ function is unknown) = sepsis. Septic shock = vasopressor-dependent MAP ≥ 65 + lactate > 2 mmol/L despite adequate fluid. Absolute mortality figures above are indicative, not calibrated to a specific cohort.",
